# 任务追踪 hook 的临时态（每任务的 trace .json 保留，仅忽略中间标记）
superharness/trace/.state/
# dogfood 安装产物（本仓库自装时生成；真正的插件源在 template/）
# 注：Ralph 运行时文件现位于 .claude/superharness/ralph/，已被下面的 .claude/superharness/ 覆盖忽略
# settings.json 引用上面的 marketplace 目录，二者须一起留在本地，不提交
.claude/superharness/
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.flavor
FLAVOR.md
# superharness brainstorm mind-map session state (transient)
.claude/superharness/brainstorm/
# superharness brainstorm mind-map session state (transient)
.superharness/
# superharness ralph runtime state (per-task tracking + retry)
.flavor/superharness/ralph/
# superharness worktree isolation dirs
.worktrees/
# generated Flavor plugin release directories and archives
release/
# superharness onboarding analysis cache (regenerable, never committed)
.claude/superharness/onboarding/
# superharness onboarding analysis cache (regenerable, never committed)
.flavor/superharness/onboarding/
